              "# Trump threatens to slap tariffs on an additional $200 billion in Chinese goods, raising trade tensions\nReporting from BEIJING — President Trump, moving to amp up pressure on China to make trade concessions, threatened late Monday to impose tariffs on an additional $200 billion in Chinese imports and to double that amount if Beijing retaliates with countermeasures",

